'''Shepherd of Souls''' is a [[keystone passive skill]]/[[keyword]] which causes non-[[aura]] [[Vaal skill]]s to have significantly less Soul Cost but also increase their Soul Cost per Vaal skill used in the past 8 seconds.

==Sources==
* {{il|Yaomac's Accord}}
* [[Corruption's Embrace]] ([[Chaos Bloodline]])
* [[Forbidden Secrets]] ([[Architect of Chaos]] in [[Legacy of Phrecia]]-enabled leagues)
* [[Runesmithing]] [[wand]] enchantment {{c|enchanted|Shepherd of Souls}} (legacy)

==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.23.0|
* Shepherd of Souls, granted by the Yaomac's Accord Unique Sceptre, no longer causes other Vaal Skills to gain 50% of the consumed Souls when you use a Vaal Skill, and no longer causes Non-Vaal Skills to deal 30% less Damage. Instead, it now causes Vaal Non-Aura Skills to have 80% less Soul Cost, and Vaal Non-Aura Skills to have 100% increased Soul Cost per Vaal Skill used in the past 8 seconds.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.14.0|
* Introduced to the game.
}}
{{Version history table end}}

